Bundled indicator data in app/src/main/assets/iocs/
  From the Zero Breach Toolkit (https://github.com/interplains/Zero-Breach-Toolkit),
  curated selection dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0.
  Values originate from published research by ESET, Cisco Talos, SentinelLabs, Meta,
  Volexity, Palo Alto Unit 42, Lookout, Amnesty International's Security Lab, the
  Citizen Lab and the MVT project; see the file headers for citations and per-source
  notices.

Stalkerware fingerprint list (app/.../stalkerware/Fingerprints.kt) is hand-maintained
from public product names.
